    {
      "kind": "How",
      "label": "How",
      "value": "Subcontracted execution with certified concrete batch (25 MPa), 12.5mm CA-50 steel rebar cages, mechanical excavation with hydraulic breaker for rock sockets, followed by hand-finished formwork, 100mm blinding layer, vibration-immersed pouring and wet-curing for 7 days under geotextile blankets.",
